title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/rote_fahne.jpg
#subtitle: Setting the direction for our newspapers and radio.

= Media

The KPD runs Die Rote Fahne. We could use the media for various purposes...

- @more_paper
- @less_paper
- @ideological
- @radio
- @radio_2
- @radio_3
- @radio_4
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@more_paper
title: Increase funding for Die Rote Fahne.
subtitle: By increasing funding, we can have higher quality and more available papers. -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rural_connection += 0.5; worker_kpd += 4*(1 - dissent); rural_kpd += 3*(1-dissent)

Our subsidizations lets us reduce the price of our papers, expanding their reach in urban and rural areas.

@less_paper
title: We cut funding for Die Rote Fahn.
subtitle: +1 resources
on-arrival: workers_kpd -= 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); rural_kpd -= 1*(1-dissent); resources +=1

For whatever reason, we are forced to cut funding for our newspaper. This reduces our reach among the population.

@ideological
title: We push the Marxist Leninist party line.
subtitle: Reduce the influence of the other factions to stay inline with the comintern.
on-arrival: left_opposition_strength -= 6; right_opposition_strength -= 6; marxist_leninist_dissent -= 6; conciliator_dissent -= 6;left_opposition_strength -= 6; right_opposition_strength -= 6; marxist_leninist_strength += 6; conciliator_strength -= 6; workers_kpd += 2*(1 - dissent)

We will follow our Comintern comrades ideologically.

@radio
title: Why not fund a radio station?
subtitle: -2 resources
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio = 0
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 2; new_middle_kpd += 4*(1 - dissent); old_middle_kpd += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_kpd += 2*(1 - dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent) if pacifism > 1

Our new radio station allows us to connect to people in a more intimate setting than before, spreading the message of socialism along with music and other popular content. Since most proletarians cannot afford family radios right now, we are reaching the new middle class(the old middle class still opposes us), a fact of which our comrades are painfully aware. Still, not taking advantage of this new medium would be giving the reactionaries who do a free victory.

@radio_2
title: We must keep on building up our radio network.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 0 and radio <= 3
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_kpd += 5*(1 - dissent); workers_kpd += 3*(1 - dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2;

Our new radio network has a mix of popular and political programming, and is proving a success. The new middle class, previously considered labor aristocrats resistant to socialism, is becoming more receptive.

@radio_3
title: We must keep on building up our radio network.
subtitle: It is now financially self-sufficient, and does not require any more resources.
view-if: radio > 3 and radio <= 5 and year <= 1931
on-arrival: radio += 1; new_middle_kpd += 5*(1 - dissent); workers_kpd += 4*(1 - dissent); rural_kpd += 3*(1 - dissent); unemployed_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent)*(democratization-2) if democratization > 2

Our radio network has become a successful tool for spreading our message.

@radio_4
title: We should keep on supporting our radio network.
subtitle: As radio becomes more common, the novelty is beginning to wear off, and radio is becoming saturated in society. -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 3 and (radio >= 6 or year >= 1932) and radio <= 9
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_kpd += 3*(1 - dissent); old_middle_kpd += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_kpd += 3*(1 - dissent); rural_kpd += 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_kpd += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 2*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; pro_republic += 2*(1-dissent)*(democratization-2) if democratization > 2

We are continuing to invest in our radio stations. Both commercial and political radio are becoming more prevalent, making it harder to spread our message amidst the competition.
